[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303180605","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110615#issuecomment-3303180605","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110615","id":3303180605,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E4ok9","user":{"login":"hsvfan-jan","id":73224846,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMjI0ODQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73224846?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan","html_url":"https://github.com/hsvfan-jan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T14:07:58Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T14:07:58Z","body":"I'm against this change, as the VHS circle is a bit outdated and OKHSL has many advantages over it. Artistically, I find it much easier to choose and adjust the \"perfect\" colour with OKHSL circles and rectangles.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure if there's a good way around the unexpected white circle, though. It'd be possible to change the default colour in general or only when clicking the colour picker for the first time. Maybe there is a better solution.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303180605/reactions","total_count":10,"+1":1,"-1":3,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":4,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303514545","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110615#issuecomment-3303514545","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110615","id":3303514545,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E56Gx","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T15:23:11Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T15:23:11Z","body":"I personally like OKHSL too, but I'm OK with the VHS circle as the default color picker, it's more widely recognized.\r\n\r\nYou can still choose your preferred color picker through editor settings.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303514545/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":9,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3304723850","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110615#issuecomment-3304723850","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110615","id":3304723850,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E-hWK","user":{"login":"hsvfan-jan","id":73224846,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMjI0ODQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73224846?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan","html_url":"https://github.com/hsvfan-jan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T22:18:52Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T22:19:39Z","body":"In HEAVY PAINT (developed with Godot), it is an OKHSL rectangle. There, white being a default doesn't have the same problem as the circle (or OKHSL rectangle) in Godot. Something like this would be ideal imo\r\n\r\n![IMG_2D239217E4AB-1](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/34baa355-ed34-4732-8ae2-1d2d0f9b71e2)","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3304723850/reactions","total_count":10,"+1":10,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3305001285","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110615#issuecomment-3305001285","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110615","id":3305001285,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E_lFF","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-18T00:48:38Z","updated_at":"2025-09-18T00:48:38Z","body":"I would also recommend a OKHSL rectangle. We would need to implement it though.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3305001285/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3310467794","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110615#issuecomment-3310467794","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110615","id":3310467794,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FUbrS","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-19T04:14:49Z","updated_at":"2025-09-19T04:14:49Z","body":"We already have OKHSL rectangles, no?\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107249","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3310467794/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3311699306","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110615#issuecomment-3311699306","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110615","id":3311699306,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FZIVq","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-19T10:42:38Z","updated_at":"2025-09-19T10:42:38Z","body":"This PR chose VHS Circle because https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/6688#issuecomment-1505940000 :\r\n\r\n> I wonder if we can resolve this issue without changing the default color picker shape. I believe many apps use a circular shape by default, yet they don't have this issue where the shape appears fully white in new ColorPickers.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3311699306/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3311943272","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110615#issuecomment-3311943272","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110615","id":3311943272,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FaD5o","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-19T12:06:28Z","updated_at":"2025-09-19T12:06:28Z","body":"> We already have OKHSL rectangles, no?\r\n\r\nYes\r\n<img width=\"326\" height=\"293\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d26c2174-7c4f-419f-94cb-ce656ae72fcf\" />\r\n<img width=\"315\" height=\"320\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/170369eb-0788-48cc-b1ef-e8766d2f954f\" />\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3311943272/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3312100248","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110615#issuecomment-3312100248","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110615","id":3312100248,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FaqOY","user":{"login":"hsvfan-jan","id":73224846,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMjI0ODQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73224846?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan","html_url":"https://github.com/hsvfan-jan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-19T12:57:18Z","updated_at":"2025-09-19T13:10:54Z","body":"In Godot, setting the default saturation to 100% (or anything other than 0%) still leaves the default colour at #ffffff (full white), and shows the colours. In my opinion, using this as a default would be the best solution, as it'd solve the unexpected \"white wall\" (or circle), and leave the OKH(S)L as a default, too.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"311\" height=\"556\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-09-19 at 14 49 13\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3af02174-f7de-4821-86d7-0442b059da14\" />\r\n\r\nUsing a circle because other apps use it is not a strong enough argument to me at least. Personally, I find it easier to only have to think about left and right (for hue) compared to the circular motion. With the circle, I find it more difficult to stay in hue when I'm close to the white point. In the rectangle, I can't \"overshoot\" to the other side (think of going from bright purple to bright green). While I know it's possible to mitigate this problem by adjusting each slider, it's often more convenient to simply dragging the cursor.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3312100248/reactions","total_count":15,"+1":13,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4421539423","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110615#issuecomment-4421539423","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110615","id":4421539423,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABB4tWXw","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-11T14:17:25Z","updated_at":"2026-05-11T14:17:25Z","body":"I'll ask for opinions with the usability team.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4421539423/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4422497283","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110615#issuecomment-4422497283","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110615","id":4422497283,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABB5n0Aw","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-11T16:11:01Z","updated_at":"2026-05-11T16:11:01Z","body":"A bit torn on this but leaning towards VHS!\r\n\r\nI just spent around 25 minutes reading to learn what OKHSL is and what problems it's trying to solve, which already in itself seems like a sign that it's not a very easy default. As I understand most people don't know what it is either because most apps default to VHS. Now that I learned what it is I think it's awesome and I will probably use it, but I don't think it's the best default if it takes time to adapt to when starting with Godot. It's best to reduce friction for new users as much as possible and make the circle behave just like they're used to, they can discover new color pickers in their own time ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4422497283/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4424121725","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110615#issuecomment-4424121725","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110615","id":4424121725,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABB7K9fQ","user":{"login":"hsvfan-jan","id":73224846,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMjI0ODQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73224846?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan","html_url":"https://github.com/hsvfan-jan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-11T19:21:47Z","updated_at":"2026-05-11T19:21:47Z","body":"> because most apps default to VHS\r\n\r\nNote that this is because it has been the default for ages since it was easy to implement without too complicated colour theory.\r\n\r\nOKHSL is relatively new, and given the arguments above, has quite a few advantages which solve VHS's problems. I don't think we have to keep an ancient as default if better alternatives exist. If OKHSL would be harder or more complicated to use, I'd totally understand the usability point but I don't think it is harder or more complicated to use. If anything, it should be more intuitive for new users. For year-long artists, I'd expect they won't have a hard time to adapt and might even find it a great tool, just as you:\r\n\r\n> Now that I learned what it is I think it's awesome and I will probably use it","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4424121725/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4426457390","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110615#issuecomment-4426457390","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110615","id":4426457390,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABB9ZhLg","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-12T01:18:40Z","updated_at":"2026-05-12T01:18:40Z","body":"I'm fine with changing the default to any of the three HSV options. OKHSL is a fantastic colour space for doing procedural colour blending and animation... But I'm not entirely convinced that it's always the best tool for the job when picking colours for a limited display. A lot of the time I want \"the most saturated colour of something like this hue that I can display on my screen\" as a starting point. Getting there with OKHSL is akward, but trivial with HVS. Conversely, saying \"I want this perceptual lightness and then I want to choose a hue and saturation that matches this lightness\" is a lot easier with OKHSL.\r\n\r\nSo there's no perfect colour picker... and it's probably better to fix the issue of an all white (as in: unusable) circle appearing by default and instead presenting a picker that is actually usable right out the gate without needing to first pick a lightness for your colour.\r\n\r\nThere are colorimetric issues with the \"value\" part of HSV in Godot because this is all sRGB-encoded colour values, so the \"value\" actually also changes the saturation/hue of the colour rather than directly adjusting its brightness. (Conversely the new HDR intensity slider directly adjusts the colour's brightness without affecting saturation/hue.) But this really doesn't matter in practice, as perceived hue and colourfulness changes as intensity changes anyway.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4426457390/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4753515352","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110615#issuecomment-4753515352","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110615","id":4753515352,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG1TjWA","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T17:13:24Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T17:13:24Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4753515352/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4897283362","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110615#issuecomment-4897283362","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110615","id":4897283362,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI-adIg","user":{"login":"Deozaan","id":227734,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzczNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/227734?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deozaan","html_url":"https://github.com/Deozaan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deozaan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deozaan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deozaan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deozaan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deozaan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deozaan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deozaan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deozaan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deozaan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-06T20:23:00Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T20:23:00Z","body":"Can you also change it so that the Hue slider under the circle actually shows the different hues instead of being all white? That is also very confusing and a frustrating default.\r\n\r\nThe voices in favor of using the VHS circle seemed to want to quickly change between saturated colors, so setting default saturation to 100% seems like a sensible default to help alleviate this issue.\r\n\r\n\r\nI'd argue that the HSV or RGB sliders under the circle should not show a preview of the final, mixed color. They should show \"pure\" colors instead. If I'm adjusting the hue slider, I want to see the actual hue I'm selecting. If I'm adjusting the red slider, I want to see the amount of red I'm selecting without the blue or green mixed in it. It's so confusing when the Hue preview is all white, or the Red preview contains no red at all. There's already a final mixed color preview just above the sliders. Show me the preview of the final color there, and let the sliders show me what I'm actually selecting rather than the effect it will have when mixed.\r\n\r\nImagine a painter trying to mix paints on their palette, but all their tubes of paint show a preview of the final mixed color. So first they all look white. Then the painter guesses \"this is about where I usually keep my green paints\" and puts something close to green on the palette. Then the painter wants to mix in some red paint, but all the tubes of paint look different shades of green now, with little hints of yellow and cyan, because green is the only color on the palette so far. This is obviously ridiculous, but it is what it's like trying to use the sliders currently.\r\n\r\nI'm not an artist, so I've never done a deep dive into the various types of color wheels. But I have used a variety of art/paint programs over the decades, and I've never been confused by or had any trouble with any other default color picker in any other program.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4897283362/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]